{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ZCEMPTAXD11792966767.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>隨著市場對AI人工智能股份的前景憂慮加深，高盛下調韓國綜合指數目標達兩成半。</p><p></p><p>最新的十二個月目標由原先的12,000點，下調至9,000點。高盛在今年六月、當AI概念股下挫時，仍維持指數目標在12,000點。該行解釋，市場正計入一個過度負面的基本面前景，下調目標是為了納入市場可能如何評估相關基本面的更保守假設，但仍認為當前市場的風險回報具有吸引力。</p><p></p><p>韓國綜合指數上周五收市報5,550點。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:40.904454+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":195,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.873373+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:25.606421+00:00","content_hash":"f50c47a00bdfbbe7d3a695b87899be09bc440a3406cdb8b9b61ab8127ff21a2f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:40.904454+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}